# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# HFSS (AEDT) IronPython script -- small coded board: 70 mm (across flats) hexagon, 102 G cells, 816 diode boundaries, centre monopole. Generated by lwmom (Phase 28 HFSS-first path).
# MODEL_ONLY / NOT_HFSS_VALIDATED. Diode package inductance 0 nH (NOT_AVAILABLE_FROM_CURRENT_DATA, assumed zero). Sets the diode states of the built model from a coding CSV.
# AEDT calls: VERIFIED in AEDT (3x3 smoke build, 2026-10-24): CreatePolyline sheets, Unite, AssignPerfectE, AssignLumpedRLC (ON: R only, OFF: C only, one element type per sheet), far-field sphere.
